ASSEMBLY (all from the back)\P1. Display (4), tab first into the lug\Ppocket, PCB on the housing step.\P2. Motor (6) into the ring on the lug\Pskin; button (8) into its wall hole.\P3. Midframe (2) with XIAO (5), battery\P(9) and battery switch (11).\
  3
P4. Back cover (3): 4 rim + 2 lug hooks\Psnap into the housing grooves.\P5. USB plug (7): barb through the +X\Pslot, then into the USB-C pocket.\P6. Screen protector (10) on the clean,\Pdry front face.\POverall %%c42.2 x 65.8 x 13.74.\PSection fill: 
