NOTES\P1. The 3D model pet_case.step (source pet_case.step.py) is the master; undimensioned features per model.\P2. FDM, PETG, 0.4 nozzle, 0.12-0.16 layers, 3-4 walls, 30 % infill.\P3. Angles are CCW from +X, seen from the front (display side).\P4. W
  3
indow %%c34.6 (0.4 lip over the glass edge), centred 0.335 below the body axis (toward USB-C).\P5. Hook groove R20.0 x z 4.6-6.8 (detail C); lug side grooves 0.7 deep, y 31.8-36.4. Pry notch 5 x 0.8 at 230\Pdeg.\P6. USB plug anchor slot 3.4 x 1.4 + r
  3
ecess (+X); button hole 3.6 x 2.0, %%c6.4 dimple (-X).\P7. LCD recess %%c36 (USB half), R18.5 on the tab half, both from the window centre; inner corners to the neck\Ppocket R1.0.\P8. LCD neck / FPC pocket: neck outline + 1.0 all round. Motor ring %%
  1
c10.5 x 1.0 on the lug skin.
